source: crates/daemon/tests/cli_help.rs
expression: stdout
---
What needs you, not what arrived: replies you owe, promises coming due, threads waiting on someone, and new mail from people, each with the reason it is there. Everything else is summarised as counts

Usage: mxr desk [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --account <ACCOUNT>  Limit to one account; the default covers every account
      --limit <LIMIT>      Rows to show per lane; each lane still reports its total [default: 25]
      --format <FORMAT>    [possible values: table, json, jsonl, csv, ids]
  -h, --help               Print help
